msgstr "一部の GitHub リポジトリの対応付けは保存されませんでした:"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:174
msgid "A verification run has been scheduled."
msgstr "検証の実行を予約しました。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:193
#. translators: %s: site time zone name (e.g. Asia/Tokyo or +09:00).
#, php-format
msgid "Daily run time (site time zone: %s)"
msgstr "毎日の実行時刻(サイトのタイムゾーン: %s)"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:200
msgid ""
"The verification run starts automatically at this time every day, in the "
"site time zone (Settings > General). External HTTP mode (below) also uses "
"this time to decide when to start the daily run."
msgstr ""
"検証は毎日この時刻に自動で始まります。時刻は「設定 > 一般」のタイムゾーンで"
"す。外部 HTTP モード(下記)も、この時刻を毎日の実行を始める目安にします。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:206
msgid "External HTTP time budget (seconds)"
msgstr "外部 HTTP の時間予算(秒)"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:211
msgid ""
"When an external scheduler calls POST /wp-json/wpcv/v1/run, this is how long "
"(per request) it keeps advancing the run before returning. Keep it well "
"under your host's max_execution_time."
msgstr ""
"外部のスケジューラーが POST /wp-json/wpcv/v1/run を呼んだとき、1回のリクエス"
"トで実行を進める時間の上限です。ホストの max_execution_time よりかなり短くし"
"てください。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:217
msgid "Strict mode"
msgstr "strict mode"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:222
msgid ""
"Report readme.txt / readme.md changes as findings instead of suppressing "
"them."
msgstr "readme.txt / readme.md の変更を、抑制せずに検出結果として報告する。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:225
msgid ""
"By default, changes limited to readme.txt/readme.md are treated as a low-"
"risk \"soft change\" and suppressed automatically. Enable strict mode to see "
"every difference, including those files."
msgstr ""
"既定では、readme.txt / readme.md だけの変更は低リスクな「soft change」として"
"自動的に抑制します。strict mode を有効にすると、これらのファイルを含むすべて"
"の差分を表示します。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:232
msgid "Stat-based change detection"
msgstr "stat 差分検知"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:237
msgid ""
"Track file size and timestamps of plugins that cannot be verified against "
"checksums, and report changes since the previous run."
msgstr ""
"チェックサムで照合できないプラグインのファイルサイズとタイムスタンプを記録"
"し、前回の実行からの変更を報告する。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:240
msgid ""
"Applies to custom or premium plugins and mu-plugin loaders that have no "
"official checksums. The first run only records a baseline. When a plugin "
"version changes, its baseline is rebuilt without reporting changes. File "
"contents are not read unless content-hash comparison is also enabled below."
msgstr ""
"公式のチェックサムが無い独自・有料のプラグインと、mu-plugin の loader が対象"
"です。最初の実行ではベースラインを記録するだけです。プラグインのバージョンが"
"変わると、変更を報告せずにベースラインを作り直します。下の内容ハッシュ比較も"
"有効にしない限り、ファイルの中身は読みません。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:247
msgid "Content-hash comparison for custom plugins"
msgstr "独自プラグインの内容ハッシュ比較"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:252
msgid ""
"Also compute a content hash for custom/premium plugins and mu-plugin "
"loaders, and report a change even when file size and modified time stay the "
"same."
msgstr ""
"独自・有料のプラグインと mu-plugin の loader の内容ハッシュも計算し、ファイル"
"サイズと更新日時が同じでも変更を報告する。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:255
msgid ""
"Detects a same-size rewrite that preserves the timestamp, which size/"
"timestamp tracking alone cannot catch. This reads file contents on every run "
"and adds I/O cost, so it is off by default; consider enabling it only for "
"sites with a small number of custom plugins. Files larger than a fixed size "
"limit fall back to size/timestamp tracking only."
msgstr ""
"サイズもタイムスタンプも保ったまま書き換えるケースを検出できます。サイズ・タ"
"イムスタンプの追跡だけでは検出できません。実行のたびにファイルの中身を読み、"
"I/O の負荷が増えるため既定では無効です。独自プラグインが少ないサイトだけで有"
"効にすることをお勧めします。一定のサイズを超えるファイルは、サイズ・タイムス"
"タンプの追跡だけに戻ります。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:262
msgid "Unrecorded version change alerts"
msgstr "記録のないバージョン変更のアラート"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:267
msgid "Alert on version changes that did not go through the WordPress updater."
msgstr "WordPress の更新機構を通らないバージョン変更をアラートで知らせる。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:270
msgid ""
"Turn this off on sites that deploy via git, FTP, or Composer, where "
"legitimate version changes never produce an update event."
msgstr ""
"git・FTP・Composer でデプロイするサイトでは、正当なバージョン変更でも更新イベ"
"ントが発生しないため、この設定を無効にしてください。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:277
msgid "History retention"
msgstr "履歴の保持期間"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:288
msgid ""
"Delete run history, per-target results and findings older than this period. "
"The newest verified result of each target, results still being processed, "
"and records needed to avoid repeating an alert are always kept. The default "
"is 12 months; choose \"Keep forever\" to keep everything. Older history is "
"removed gradually at the end of the following runs."
msgstr ""
"この期間より古い実行履歴・対象ごとの結果・検出結果を削除します。各対象の最新"
"の照合結果、処理中の結果、アラートの重複を避けるために必要な記録は、常に残し"
"ます。既定は 12 か月です。すべて保持するには「無期限に保持」を選んでくださ"
"い。古い履歴は、その後の実行の終わりに少しずつ削除されます。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:295
msgid "GitHub repository mappings"
msgstr "GitHub リポジトリの対応付け"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:300
msgid ""
"Verify a plugin or theme against the assets of its GitHub Release instead of "
"wordpress.org. One mapping per line: plugin:{slug} or theme:{stylesheet}, "
"then owner/repo, then optionally the start of the asset file name. The "
"Release is found by the installed version (tag \"1.2.3\" or \"v1.2.3\"). "
"Plugins and themes that are not listed are verified as before. Invalid lines "
"and repeated targets are dropped when saving; comment lines (starting with "
"#) are not kept. Directories that contain a .git entry are never compared "
"with GitHub."
msgstr ""
"wordpress.org の代わりに、GitHub Release のアセットでプラグインまたはテーマを"
"照合します。1行に1件、plugin:{slug} または theme:{stylesheet}、続けて owner/"
"repo、必要ならアセットのファイル名の先頭部分を書きます。Release はインストー"
"ル済みのバージョンから探します(タグは \"1.2.3\" または \"v1.2.3\")。一覧にな"
"いプラグインとテーマは、今までどおり照合します。不正な行と重複した対象は保存"
"時に捨てられ、コメント行(# で始まる行)は保存されません。.git を含むディレクト"
"リは GitHub と照合しません。"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of "target → owner/repo".
#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:308
#, php-format
msgid "Also mapped by the wpcv_github_mappings filter: %s"
msgstr "wpcv_github_mappings フィルターによる対応付けもあります: %s"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:317
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "警告:"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of theme stylesheets.
#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:322
#, php-format
msgid ""
"These themes are bundled with WordPress core, so their mappings are ignored "
"and they are verified against wordpress.org and the core checksums: %s"
msgstr ""
"これらのテーマは WordPress コアに同梱されているため、対応付けは無視され、"
"wordpress.org とコアのチェックサムで照合されます: %s"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:332
msgid "GitHub token"
msgstr "GitHub トークン"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:335
msgid ""
"A token is configured (WPCV_GITHUB_TOKEN or the wpcv_github_token filter). "
"Its value is never shown or stored in the database."
msgstr ""
"トークンが設定されています(WPCV_GITHUB_TOKEN または wpcv_github_token フィル"
"ター)。値は表示せず、データベースにも保存しません。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:337
msgid "No token is configured."
msgstr "トークンは設定されていません。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:339
msgid ""
"Public repositories work without one, but unauthenticated GitHub API "
"requests have a low rate limit. For private repositories or a higher limit, "
"define WPCV_GITHUB_TOKEN in wp-config.php."
msgstr ""
"公開リポジトリはトークンなしでも使えますが、認証なしの GitHub API はレート制"
"限が低くなります。非公開リポジトリや上限の引き上げが必要な場合は、wp-"
"config.php で WPCV_GITHUB_TOKEN を定義してください。"

#. translators: %s: date and time in the site time zone.
#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:348
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The GitHub rate limit has been reached. GitHub is not contacted until %s."
msgstr ""
"GitHub のレート制限に達しました。%s まで GitHub に問い合わせません。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:360
msgid "Alert recipients"
msgstr "アラートの宛先"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:365
msgid ""
"Email addresses that receive an alert when new or resolved findings appear. "
"One per line (commas and semicolons also work). Invalid addresses are "
"dropped when saving. If empty, no alert is sent and a warning is shown in "
"the admin screens."
msgstr ""
"新規または解消の検出結果が出たときにアラートを受け取るメールアドレスです。1行"
"に1件(カンマ・セミコロン区切りも使えます)。不正なアドレスは保存時に捨てられま"
"す。空の場合はアラートを送らず、管理画面に警告を表示します。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:370
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "変更を保存"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:373
#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:406
msgid "Send test alert"
msgstr "テストアラートを送信"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:377
msgid "Test alert sent successfully."
msgstr "テストアラートを送信しました。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:381
msgid ""
"Alert recipients is empty. Set at least one address above and save, then try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"アラートの宛先が空です。上でアドレスを1件以上設定して保存してから、もう一度お"
"試しください。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:389
msgid "Test alert failed to send."
msgstr "テストアラートの送信に失敗しました。"

#. translators: %s: error message from wp_mail().
#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:392
#, php-format
msgid "Test alert failed to send: %s"
msgstr "テストアラートの送信に失敗しました: %s"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:404
msgid ""
"Send a test email to the alert recipients above, to confirm the address is "
"correct before relying on it."
msgstr ""
"上のアラートの宛先にテストメールを送り、アドレスが正しいことを確認します。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:409
#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:420
msgid "Run now"
msgstr "今すぐ実行"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:413
msgid ""
"Start a verification run immediately instead of waiting for the daily "
"schedule."
msgstr "毎日の予定を待たず、すぐに検証の実行を始めます。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:429
msgid "REST API token (run)"
msgstr "REST API トークン(実行)"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:433
#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:456
msgid "New token generated. Copy it now — it will not be shown again:"
msgstr ""
"新しいトークンを発行しました。今すぐコピーしてください。再表示はできません:"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:440
msgid ""
"A token is defined via the WPCV_REST_TOKEN constant and takes precedence "
"over any token generated here."
msgstr ""
"WPCV_REST_TOKEN 定数でトークンが定義されています。ここで発行したトークンより"
"優先されます。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:442
msgid ""
"A token has been issued. Generating a new one immediately invalidates the "
"previous token."
msgstr ""
"トークンは発行済みです。新しく発行すると、以前のトークンはすぐに無効になりま"
"す。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:444
msgid ""
"No token has been issued yet. External systems need this token to call POST /"
"wp-json/wpcv/v1/run."
msgstr ""
"まだトークンが発行されていません。外部のシステムが POST /wp-json/wpcv/v1/run "
"を呼ぶには、このトークンが必要です。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:449
