msgstr "新しいトークンを発行"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:452
msgid "REST API token (read-only)"
msgstr "REST API トークン(読み取り専用)"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:463
msgid ""
"A read-only token has been issued. Generating a new one immediately "
"invalidates the previous one."
msgstr ""
"読み取り専用トークンは発行済みです。新しく発行すると、以前のトークンはすぐに"
"無効になります。"

#: includes/admin/class-wpcv-page-settings.php:465
msgid ""
"No read-only token has been issued yet. External systems need this "
"(separate) token to call GET /wp-json/wpcv/v1/status and GET /wp-json/wpcv/"
